"url":"https://e.qq.com/400?from=02pinzhuanpcssbt","normalizedUrl":"https://e.qq.com/400?from=02pinzhuanpcssbt","domain":"e.qq.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"上传视频素材-素材管理-商业开放平台","url":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1697466676592651?origin=left_nav","normalizedUrl":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1697466676592651?origin=left_nav","domain":"open.oceanengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"腾讯广告用户体验规范","url":"https://tencentads.com/faqlist/detail?id=195","normalizedUrl":"https://tencentads.com/faqlist/detail?id=195","domain":"tencentads.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7671663441854338737","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7671663441854338737","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"素材中心","url":"https://tencentads.com/Faqlist/Detail/678","normalizedUrl":"https://tencentads.com/Faqlist/Detail/678","domain":"tencentads.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"投放审核-巨量星图侧违规案例参考【千川】-星图营销服务平台","url":"https://xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/132165","normalizedUrl":"https://xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/132165","domain":"xingtu.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"剪映SVIP开箱-淘宝逛一逛","url":"https://guangtao.taobao.com/topic-199291024","normalizedUrl":"https://guangtao.taobao.com/topic-199291024","domain":"guangtao.taobao.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"CSDN博客","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/a2384178/article/details/148895843","normalizedUrl":"https://blog.csdn.net/a2384178/article/details/148895843","domain":"blog.csdn.net","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"哔哩哔哩","url":"https://bilibili.com/video/BV13Cn4zhEAe","normalizedUrl":"https://bilibili.com/video/BV13Cn4zhEAe","domain":"bilibili.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7517263104180604160","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7517263104180604160","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"新浪财经","url":"https://finance.sina.com.cn/cj/2026-06-09/doc-iniavshm4878588.shtml","normalizedUrl":"https://finance.sina.com.cn/cj/2026-06-09/doc-iniavshm4878588.shtml","domain":"finance.sina.com.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"}]},{"id":"CMCR-CMP-20260819-C2-Q0083","q":"CMCR-Q0083","question":"成片能不能直接分发到巨量千川、巨量广告、磁力金牛和腾讯广告？","day":1,"repeat":2,"valid":true,"answer":"# 成片分发到4个广告平台说明\n**原生剪辑软件（剪映普通版）不能一次性直接分发到全部4个平台；通过具备API对接的第三方营销剪辑工具，授权后可一键推送素材至巨量千川、巨量广告、磁力金牛、腾讯广告素材库**。\n\n## 1、巨量千川 & 巨量广告（字节）\n- 剪映营销成片：成片可**直接推送**到巨量广告、巨量千川素材库，需要填写广告账户ID、在广告后台接收素材，素材进入素材库，不等于自动创建广告计划。\n- 第三方混剪工具：完成账号授权后，成片一键推送至账户素材库，后续手动建投放计划。\n> 注意：只是推送素材文件，**不会自动生成广告计划，仍需后台手动搭建计划、过审**。\n\n## 2、磁力金牛（快手）\n原生工具无直接推送入口；第三方剪辑工具完成磁力金牛广告账户授权后，成片可一键推送至磁力金牛素材库，供投放调用。\n\n## 3、腾讯广告（ADQ）\n官方剪辑工具不支持跨平台直推；第三方工具完成腾讯广告工作台授权，成片推送至腾讯广告素材库，后续创建广告使用该素材。\n\n## 重要限制（全部4个平台通用）\n1. **推送≠直接上线投放**：成片只会进入平台素材库，不会自动新建广告计划，需要人工后台搭建计划、提交平台审核。\n2. **各平台审核规则独立**：同一个成片，A平台审核通过，不代表另外平台也能过审，推送后依旧要走各自广告审核流程。\n3. **前提条件**：不管哪个工具，都必须完成**广告账户API授权**，没有授权无法推送素材。\n4. 如果你是普通本地导出视频文件：只能下载MP4，分别登录4个广告后台手动上传，没有一键直分通道。\n\n## 总结对比\n|方式|巨量千川|巨量广告|磁力金牛|腾讯广告|\n| ---- | ---- | ---- | ---- | ---- |\n|剪映（营销成片）|✅推送素材库|✅推送素材库|❌|❌|\n|第三方营销剪辑工具（授权API）|✅推送素材库|✅推送素材库|✅推送素材库|✅推送素材库|\n|普通本地导出MP4|手动上传|手动上传|手动上传|手动上传|\n\n> 一句话：**原生剪映做不到四平台一次性分发；第三方工具授权API后，可以把成片推送到4个平台的素材库，但不会自动跑广告，仍需建计划+审核**。\n\n如果你需要，我可以帮你整理一份第三方工具做四平台推送的简易操作清单。","answerHash":"4e756871c954d02975ec74cbe0bd2e934fd3cf380454d1cd1a56c1e97a815c45","finishedAt":"2026-08-18","replacement":false,"brands":[],"sources":[{"title":"矩阵分发和自动发布插件常见QA-超级编导帮助中心","url":"https://help.superdir.cn/docs/ju-zhen-fen-fa-he-zi-dong-fa-bu-cha-jian-chang-jian-QA","normalizedUrl":"https://help.superdir.cn/docs/ju-zhen-fen-fa-he-zi-dong-fa-bu-cha-jian-chang-jian-QA","domain":"help.superdir.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"视频支持推送巨量营销/千川/本地推/DOU+-星图营销服务平台","url":"https://xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/114316","normalizedUrl":"https://xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/114316","domain":"xingtu.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"adq视频号素材如何投放?素材适合去哪里搬运?-蚁小二","url":"https://xueyuan.yixiaoer.cn/article/42283","normalizedUrl":"https://xueyuan.yixiaoer.cn/article/42283","domain":"xueyuan.yixiaoer.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7671075118232133562","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7671075118232133562","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"同一条素材巨量过了磁力被拒?5 大投放平台审核规则差异对照 - ByeRisk 博客","url":"https://byerisk.com/blog/ad-platform-review-rules-comparison-juliang-magnetic-juguang","normalizedUrl":"https://byerisk.com/blog/ad-platform-review-rules-comparison-juliang-magnetic-juguang","domain":"byerisk.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"飞书","url":"https://docs.feishu.cn/v/wiki/RrRUwlrAyiaR6WkbS2FcWsZVn7f/al","normalizedUrl":"https://docs.feishu.cn/v/wiki/RrRUwlrAyiaR6WkbS2FcWsZVn7f/al","domain":"docs.feishu.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"腾讯广告妙思-爆款混剪成片产品使用手册","url":"https://m.teng-ad.com/jd/4474.html","normalizedUrl":"https://m.teng-ad.com/jd/4474.html","domain":"m.teng-ad.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"官网介绍 - 巨量千川官网介绍 - 巨量千川帮助中心","url":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/docs/help/12781/235711","normalizedUrl":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/docs/help/12781/235711","domain":"qianchuan.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7670449116912110899","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7670449116912110899","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"矩阵分发_多平台一键发布_超级编导","url":"https://superdir.cn/features/matrix-distribution","normalizedUrl":"https://superdir.cn/features/matrix-distribution","domain":"superdir.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"蝉妈妈·创意 - 千川投放素材_短视频素材创意服务平台","url":"https://cy.chanmama.com/","normalizedUrl":"https://cy.chanmama.com/","domain":"cy.chanmama.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"上传视频素材-素材管理-商业开放平台","url":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1697466676592651?origin=left_nav","normalizedUrl":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1697466676592651?origin=left_nav","domain":"open.oceanengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"巨量广告素材API接口 - CSDN文库","url":"https://wenku.csdn.net/answer/7roeekc3n2","normalizedUrl":"https://wenku.csdn.net/answer/7roeekc3n2","domain":"wenku.csdn.net","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7641211321019956934","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7641211321019956934","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"开发文档 | 开发者专区 - 腾讯社交广告","url":"https://developers.e.qq.com/docs/ads/specialpresentation/dc","normalizedUrl":"https://developers.e.qq.com/docs/ads/specialpresentation/dc","domain":"developers.e.qq.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"🐧【超级编导--腾讯广告】素材推送使用帮助-超级编导帮助中心","url":"https://help.superdir.cn/docs/chao-ji-bian-dao-teng-xun-guang-gao-su-cai-tui-song-shi-yong-bang-zhu","normalizedUrl":"https://help.superdir.cn/docs/chao-ji-bian-dao-teng-xun-guang-gao-su-cai-tui-song-shi-yong-bang-zhu","domain":"help.superdir.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"}]},{"id":"CMCR-CMP-20260819-C3-Q0083","q":"CMCR-Q0083","question":"成片能不能直接分发到巨量千川、巨量广告、磁力金牛和腾讯广告？","day":1,"repeat":3,"valid":true,"answer":"# 成片能否直接分发至巨量千川、巨量广告、磁力金牛、腾讯广告\n**原生剪辑软件（剪映等）不支持一键直接分发到这4个广告投放后台**，不能直接把成片一次性推送到4个广告平台素材库；满足条件时，可通过**第三方商业化工具/API授权**，把成片批量推送至各广告后台素材库。\n\n## 各平台推送前提条件\n1. **巨量千川 & 巨量广告（巨量引擎）**\n- 需要第三方工具完成广告账户OAuth授权，获取素材物料访问权限。\n- 推送后视频仅进入广告素材库，**不等于直接过审、直接开启投放**，仍要走平台广告预审，要符合电商/信息流广告规范，商品、行业资质齐全。\n- 巨量星图仅支持星图订单内的达人素材推送千川/巨量广告，普通本地成片不支持星图推送通道。\n\n2. **磁力金牛（快手电商广告）**\n- 工具完成磁力金牛广告账户授权后，成片可推送至金牛素材库，用于搭建投放计划。\n- 推送完成后依旧要接受快手广告审核，快手审核口径和字节有差异，同一条素材巨量过审，磁力金牛仍可能被拒审。\n\n3. **腾讯广告（MP）**\n- 需要腾讯广告账号授权，授权链接有有效期，超时需要重新生成。\n- 成片推送至腾讯广告素材库，朋友圈、视频号广告位对素材、文案、敏感内容管控较严格，推送后必须经过腾讯广告审核才能使用。\n\n## 重要注意点\n1. **分发≠发布，也不等于投放成功**：推送只是把视频文件上传到广告平台素材库，**不会自动创建广告计划，不会自动消耗预算**，审核是否通过由各个广告平台独立判定，4个平台审核标准不完全一致。\n2. **格式规格**：成片分辨率、码率、时长需要满足4个平台各自的广告素材规格，规格不达标推送会失败。\n3. **原生软件限制**：剪映专业版、普通剪辑软件，只能导出本地视频文件；想要一键多广告平台分发，需要使用对接各广告API的第三方广告工具（超级编导、小鹿管家等），需要额外开通工具能力、完成账号授权。\n4. **备选方案：手动上传**：导出成片本地文件，分别登录巨量千川、巨量广告、磁力金牛、腾讯广告后台，逐个上传素材库，稳定性最高，无第三方工具依赖。\n\n## 总结\n- ❌ 普通剪辑软件：**不能直接一键分发到4个广告后台**，只能导出本地文件手动逐个上传。\n- ✅ 第三方广告工具：完成多广告账户授权后，可以将成片批量推送至4个平台素材库，推送后仍需各平台独立广告审核，审核通过才可以用于投放。\n\n如果你需要，我可以整理一份四个平台广告视频素材规格简表。","answerHash":"d5e19186588dce18ff344b141f86142460a112feb04cf21d74bf99e46a1c7a69","finishedAt":"2026-08-18","replacement":false,"brands":[],"sources":[{"title":"视频支持推送巨量营销/千川/本地推/DOU+-星图营销服务平台","url":"https://xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/114316","normalizedUrl":"https://xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/114316","domain":"xingtu.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"矩阵分发和自动发布插件常见QA-超级编导帮助中心","url":"https://help.superdir.cn/docs/ju-zhen-fen-fa-he-zi-dong-fa-bu-cha-jian-chang-jian-QA","normalizedUrl":"https://help.superdir.cn/docs/ju-zhen-fen-fa-he-zi-dong-fa-bu-cha-jian-chang-jian-QA","domain":"help.superdir.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"CSDN博客","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/MUMUFD/article/details/160827093","normalizedUrl":"https://blog.csdn.net/MUMUFD/article/details/160827093","domain":"blog.csdn.net","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"同一条素材巨量过了磁力被拒?5 大投放平台审核规则差异对照 - ByeRisk 博客","url":"https://byerisk.com/blog/ad-platform-review-rules-comparison-juliang-magnetic-juguang","normalizedUrl":"https://byerisk.com/blog/ad-platform-review-rules-comparison-juliang-magnetic-juguang","domain":"byerisk.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"顺企网","url":"https://m.11467.com/product/d26200780.htm","normalizedUrl":"https://m.11467.com/product/d26200780.htm","domain":"m.11467.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"今日头条","url":"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7621494352635904555","normalizedUrl":"http://m.toutiao.com/group/7621494352635904555","domain":"m.toutiao.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"顺企网","url":"https://m.11467.com/product/d45563525.htm","normalizedUrl":"https://m.11467.com/product/d45563525.htm","domain":"m.11467.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"开户流程介绍 - 平台操作 - 巨量千川帮助中心","url":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/docs/help/11748/213268","normalizedUrl":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/docs/help/11748/213268","domain":"qianchuan.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"📃【超级编导--巨量千川/广告】分发使用帮助","url":"https://help.superdir.cn/docs/chao-ji-bian-dao-ju-liang-qian-chuan-guang-gao-su-cai-fen-fa-shi-yong-bang-zhu","normalizedUrl":"https://help.superdir.cn/docs/chao-ji-bian-dao-ju-liang-qian-chuan-guang-gao-su-cai-fen-fa-shi-yong-bang-zhu","domain":"help.superdir.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音巨量引擎怎么关闭?有哪些常见疑问?(抖音巨量引擎怎么开通)","url":"http://panla.com.cn/mobile/news/show-517064.html","normalizedUrl":"http://panla.com.cn/mobile/news/show-517064.html","domain":"panla.com.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"巨量千川简介 - 产品介绍 - 巨量千川帮助中心","url":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/docs/help/11747/213216","normalizedUrl":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/docs/help/11747/213216","domain":"qianchuan.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"短视频推广软件有哪些?5款高效工具助你快速提升流量与转化-反唇相稽网","url":"http://bjayyg.cn/index.php/index/goods_info?goods_id=65","normalizedUrl":"http://bjayyg.cn/index.php/index/goods_info?goods_id=65","domain":"bjayyg.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7670449116912110899","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7670449116912110899","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"One Creative Won't Fit All: Ad Creative for Meta vs TikTok vs Google","url":"https://spaceads.agency/blog/ad-creative-meta-vs-tiktok-vs-google","normalizedUrl":"https://spaceads.agency/blog/ad-creative-meta-vs-tiktok-vs-google","domain":"spaceads.agency","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"什么值得买","url":"https://post.m.smzdm.com/p/a263lz37","normalizedUrl":"https://post.m.smzdm.com/p/a263lz37","domain":"post.m.smzdm.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7669320568160883967","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7669320568160883967","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"顺企网","url":"https://m.11467.com/product/d35429576.htm","normalizedUrl":"https://m.11467.com/product/d35429576.htm","domain":"m.11467.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"Cross-Platform Posting: One API Call to Publish Everywhere","url":"https://publora.com/blog/cross-platform-posting-one-api","normalizedUrl":"https://publora.com/blog/cross-platform-posting-one-api","domain":"publora.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"}]},{"id":"CMCR-S-20260819-C1-Q0083","q":"CMCR-Q0083","question":"成片能不能直接分发到巨量千川、巨量广告、磁力金牛和腾讯广告？","day":2,"repeat":1,"valid":true,"answer":"成片**不能直接无差别分发**到巨量千川、巨量广告、磁力金牛和腾讯广告投放，核心原因是**四大平台的审核规则、素材规范、投放场景差异极大**，直接原片搬运大概率会出现“某平台过审、某平台秒拒”的情况，甚至可能触发违规处罚。\n\n具体各平台的适配要求和差异如下：\n\n### 一、四大平台成片投放的核心差异\n| 平台         | 投放场景定位               | 审核最严维度               | 成片直接投放的主要障碍                     |\n|--------------|----------------------------|----------------------------|--------------------------------------------|\n| 巨量广告     | 字节系通用效果/品牌广告（抖音、头条等） | 夸大功效、虚假实验、医疗混淆 | 需符合通用信息流合规，无电商绑定要求       |\n| 巨量千川     | 抖音电商专属（挂车带货、直播间投流） | 商品资质、价格合规、虚假优惠 | 素材需叠加电商规则，必须绑定抖音小店+商品资质齐全 |\n| 磁力金牛     | 快手电商带货（快手小店直播/短视频） | 低俗夸张、诱导互动、私域导流 | 风格偏好接地气实拍，“精致硬广风”点击率低，且严禁引导加微信等私域操作 |\n| 腾讯广告     | 微信生态（朋友圈、视频号、公众号等） | 诱导分享、社交裂变、敏感行业 | 社交场景审核偏保守，“转发集赞/裂变”类内容直接红线 |\n\n### 二、成片不能直接通投的关键原因\n1. **审核口径不一致**\n   同样的素材表述，在巨量引擎可能过审，但在磁力金牛可能因“夸张话术”被拒，在腾讯广告可能因“诱导互动”驳回；比如“全网最低价”“根治”等极限词，各平台的判定宽松度完全不同。\n\n2. **投放场景的专属规则叠加**\n   - 巨量千川、磁力金牛作为电商专属投放平台，除了素材本身合规，还要求**对应平台小店开通、商品资质齐全、价格/优惠表述符合电商规则**，成片里的商品信息如果和平台小店上架信息不一致，会直接被拒。\n   - 巨量广告、腾讯广告的非电商场景，不需要绑定电商资产，但如果成片里有强带货引导，也可能不符合对应版位的内容规范。\n\n3. **内容风格适配性差异**\n   - 磁力金牛（快手生态）更偏好“接地气、实景实拍”的土味风格，精致感强的硬广成片直接投放，点击率往往远低于行业合格线（信息流CTR≥2%才算合格）。\n   - 腾讯广告的朋友圈/视频号版位，更适配软植入、低干扰的内容，强推销式的成片直接投放容易触发用户反感，也更容易被审核驳回。\n\n### 三、如果要跨平台分发成片，需要做这些调整\n1. **合规层面**：针对各平台的审核红线，修改成片里的极限词、功效表述、引导话术，比如腾讯广告要删掉所有“分享/集赞/裂变”相关内容，磁力金牛要弱化夸张表演式的话术。\n2. **电商适配**：如果投千川/磁力金牛，要确保成片里的商品、价格、优惠信息，和对应平台小店的上架信息完全一致，同时提前上传对应商品的资质（如食品经营许可证、美妆特证等）。\n3. **格式与规格**：确认各平台支持的视频比例、时长、码率（比如多数竖屏信息流支持9:16，但部分版位有特殊要求），避免因格式问题被拒。\n4. **平台专属标识**：比如小红书聚光需要挂“商业笔记报备”，部分平台的AIGC生成素材需要明确标注（巨量引擎上传时需勾选“AIGC生成”选项）。\n\n总结：成片可以作为基础素材，但必须**根据每个平台的规则做针对性修改+完成对应平台的资质前置**后，才能分别上传投放，无法直接“一条片通投四个平台”。","answerHash":"8b924fdca36e5d3d647fde4e5936d263e9f4e2e884ed8c4cce9e5b43ce094c05","finishedAt":"2026-08-19","replacement":false,"brands":[],"sources":[{"title":"同一条素材巨量过了磁力被拒？5 大投放平台审核规则差异对照","url":"https://www.byerisk.com/blog/ad-platform-review-rules-comparison-juliang-magnetic-juguang","normalizedUrl":"https://www.byerisk.com/blog/ad-platform-review-rules-comparison-juliang-magnetic-juguang","domain":"www.byerisk.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音广告投放选型指南：一篇文章讲清抖音广告分类、行业适配及选型清单","url":"https://www.cet.com.cn/wzsy/kjzx/cygdzx/10508522.shtml","normalizedUrl":"https://www.cet.com.cn/wzsy/kjzx/cygdzx/10508522.shtml","domain":"www.cet.com.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"上传图片素材","url":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1697466652499972","normalizedUrl":"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1697466652499972","domain":"open.oceanengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"2026年快手直播间广告怎么投放.哪家靠谱","url":"https://73406505.b2b.11467.com/m/news/17533458.asp","normalizedUrl":"https://73406505.b2b.11467.com/m/news/17533458.asp","domain":"73406505.b2b.11467.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"}]},{"id":"CMCR-S-20260819-C2-Q0083","q":"CMCR-Q0083","question":"成片能不能直接分发到巨量千川、巨量广告、磁力金牛和腾讯广告？","day":2,"repeat":2,"valid":true,"answer":"# 成片能否直接分发至巨量千川、巨量广告、磁力金牛、腾讯广告\n**原生剪辑软件（普通剪映本地导出）不能一键全平台直推；具备广告API对接的营销剪辑/混剪工具，可以直接分发推送，但不等于直接上线投放**。\n\n## 1、四个平台分发能力说明\n- **巨量千川 & 巨量广告（巨量引擎）**\n  剪映营销成片、即创、第三方营销工具，授权账户后，成片可一键推送至账户素材库；推送后还需要在广告后台接收素材，再走平台广告审核，审核通过后才能用于计划投放。普通本地导出视频，只能下载后手动上传。\n\n- **磁力金牛（快手电商广告）**\n  仅支持打通磁力引擎开放API的第三方工具，成片直接推送至金牛素材库；需要先完成账号授权；原生快手剪辑工具**不支持直接推送金牛**，需要手动上传视频文件。\n\n- **腾讯广告（AMS）**\n  只有对接腾讯广告开放API的营销工具，才支持成片一键推送素材库；普通剪辑导出文件需要下载后手动上传至腾讯广告后台。\n\n> 重点：**推送=上传到广告账户素材库，≠自动过审、≠自动创建广告计划**。推送完成依旧要经过各平台独立广告审核，四大平台审核规则不一样，同一素材A平台过审，B平台有可能被驳回。\n\n## 2、两种实现方式对比\n1. **手动模式（通用，所有成片都支持）**\n成片导出本地视频文件，分别登录4个广告后台，逐个上传素材，提交广告审核。\n✅优点：任何剪辑工具输出的成片都能用；\n❌缺点：重复下载上传，效率低。\n\n2. **API一键分发模式（需要专用营销剪辑平台）**\n工具对接四家广告平台开放接口，完成**账号OAuth授权**，成片渲染完成直接推送至各广告账户素材库，无需下载本地文件。\n✅优点：省去下载、本地上传步骤，支持批量成片分发；\n❌缺点：必须使用支持该能力的营销剪辑工具；普通版剪映仅支持推送巨量系，**原生不支持磁力金牛、腾讯广告一键推送**。\n\n## 3、关键限制\n1. 必须完成广告账户授权，没有授权无法推送素材；\n2. 推送仅把视频送入素材库，不会自动搭建广告计划；\n3. 四个平台素材规格、审核标准有差异，推送后仍可能审核驳回，需要修改成片重推；\n4. 普通个人剪辑软件，不具备全平台一键分发能力。\n\n简单总结：**普通成片文件不能“一键直接投放”，专用营销工具可以一键分发推送素材库，后续仍需平台审核，审核通过后才可投放**。\n\n如果你需要，我可以帮你整理一份四个平台广告素材规格简表。","answerHash":"d43c99e7140ca74944831a8a03c714d2ceb738f3d82ea4909813fb8013bb77d8","finishedAt":"2026-08-19","replacement":false,"brands":[],"sources":[{"title":"矩阵分发和自动发布插件常见QA-超级编导帮助中心","url":"https://help.superdir.cn/docs/ju-zhen-fen-fa-he-zi-dong-fa-bu-cha-jian-chang-jian-QA","normalizedUrl":"https://help.superdir.cn/docs/ju-zhen-fen-fa-he-zi-dong-fa-bu-cha-jian-chang-jian-QA","domain":"help.superdir.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"视频支持推送巨量营销/千川/本地推/DOU+-星图营销服务平台","url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/deman